<title>BELGIUM: EU economic forecast for the Netherlands.</title>
<headline>EU economic forecast for the Netherlands.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-11-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following are the economic forecasts by the European Commission for the Netherlands:</p>
<p>				    1996	 1997</p>
<p> GDP growth (pct)		2.5	  2.8</p>
<p> Investment			5.5	  1.6</p>
<p> GDP price deflator (pct)    1.9	  2.0</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    6.8	  6.3</p>
<p> Public sector deficit*	2.6	  2.5</p>
<p> Debt/GDP ratio		 78.7	 76.8</p>
<p> Current account balance*    4.9	  5.1</p>
</text>
